        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">Hi Chris,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">Please see my replies below:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">1. The CDL-165ETHG supports up to Win7 32bit.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">2. Sure, you can set the static IP address
            (192.168.xxx.xxx) via USB Server.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">Step 1.  Click USB Server icon.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><img id="圖片_x0020_3"
              src="cid:part1.62FE7FB7.236B44EE@converters.tv" alt="描述:
              cid:image001.jpg@01CF5E1B.612FBC40" height="84" width="72"></span><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">Step 2.  Click “Options” and choose “Server
            Configurations”.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><img id="圖片_x0020_2"
              src="cid:part2.0E8221EE.9F73A4FE@converters.tv" alt="描述:
              cid:image002.jpg@01CF5E1B.612FBC40" height="524"
              width="721"></span><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"> <o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">Step 3-1. Untick “Use DHCP”<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">         3-2. Type the static IP address &amp;
            Subnet.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US">         3-3. Click “Set” to finish your
            setting.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span
style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#44546A"
            lang="EN-US"><img id="圖片_x0020_1"
              src="cid:part3.D61580E4.58D7562C@converters.tv" alt="描述:
