        <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US">Hello Roger,</span><span
            lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US"><br>
            I have a customer interested in CDL-165ETHG (our stock) and
            he has asked some questions I hope you can assist to answer.</span><span
            lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US">Copy Customer
            Email:</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US">"</span><span
            lang="EN-US"><br>
            Ethernet/USB to HDMI/VGA Converter CDL-165ETHG<br>
            <i>Product ID: 880 - Ethernet/USB to HDMI/VGA Converter
              CDL-165ETHG<br>
              Good day,<br>
              <br>
              to your interesting product CDL-165ETHG please give me
              some answers to the following questions:<br>
              <br>
              1.<br>
              Works this adapter software driver also properly with
              Windows 7 / 64bit ?<br>
              <br>
              2.<br>
              Can I use this adapter in a IP-environment like
              192.168.X.X ? <br>
              Operate such IP-configuration also with manual defined fix
              IP-adresses or only with automatic generated adresses
              (DHCP-Server)?<br>
              <br>
              3.<br>
              Or must I force to choose IP-areas like 169.254.10.X (as
              described in manual)?<br>
              <br>
              4.<br>
              If I want to order this product from you - is there a
              possibility to get a IBAN from you (or a advance bill) for
              money transfer in advance?<br>
              In principle I enter my credit card number reluctantly to
              the internet...<br>
              <br>
              Many thanks in advance for your answer<br>
              and best regards from Germany,</i><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">" <o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span lang="EN-US"><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US">Please let me
            know if able to assist?</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13.5pt" lang="EN-US">Thank you and
            look forward to your reply,</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
